      "writtenOn": "2024-10-24T08:35:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As Abe commented in https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/5875304/comment/f3782cfd_fceda2b8/ \n\nI\u0027m planning to implement the VDM version negotiation here.\nThis switch block will become something like `MIN(SVDM_VER_2_1, PD_VDO_SVDM_VERS(payload[0]))` in the next CL",
      "parentUuid": "e8c153f1_47d63e9f",
      "revId": "098170f943e69ccdb41a7b2538350de3279a3d65",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
